          Path to the Miri source file to run

  [PROGRAM_ARGS]...
          Arguments to pass to the program

Options:
      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format (pretty or JSON)

          Possible values:
          - pretty: Pretty-printed output (default)
          - json:   JSON-formatted output

          [default: pretty]

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

Global options:
  -v, --verbose...
          Increase verbosity level

      --verify-mir
          Verify RC invariants after Perceus

      --color <COLOR>
          ANSI color in diagnostics: auto, always, never

          [default: auto]

